OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters clear debris after
OL,4,Abuilding collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services are attending the
OL,7,Fscene of a partially collapsed building
OL,8,Fon the Shankill Road in Belfast.
OL,10,FFirefighters were called just before
OL,11,F08:00 BST and cleared debris to make
OL,12,Fthe area safe.
OL,14,FThe road is closed at the junctions of
OL,15,FTennent Street and Brookmount Street.
OL,17,FPolice officers are assisting with road
OL,18,Fclosures and motorists have been
OL,19,Fadvised to avoid the area. Fire crews
OL,20,Fleft just before 11:00, with building
OL,21,Fcontrol experts taking over.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
